Update vendored crates flagged by RustSec to fixed releases with
`cargo update -p <crate>@<version> --precise <new>`; the rustls crates
move to the versions zensical 0.1.1 locks:
  url 2.5.8 -> 2.5.9 (RUSTSEC-2026-0592)
  rustls 0.23.45 -> 0.23.46 (RUSTSEC-2026-0346, RUSTSEC-2026-0347,
    RUSTSEC-2026-0348, RUSTSEC-2026-0349)
  rustls-webpki 0.103.15 -> 0.103.16 (RUSTSEC-2026-0382)
  webpki-roots 1.0.9 -> 1.0.11 (RUSTSEC-2026-0381)
url 2.5.9 requires form_urlencoded 1.2.3, so cargo moved it from 1.2.2.
lexical 6 and lexical-core 0.8 (RUSTSEC-2023-0055, RUSTSEC-2023-0086) stay:
the fixed releases are semver-incompatible with swc_css_parser 26.

